            {"id": "c29-s1", "kind": "web_page", "text": "https://www.pellarden.example/about\nAbout Pellarden Mutual. Pellarden Mutual has insured farms and rural homes across the Ashby Valley since 1911. Owned by our 18,000 policyholders, we write property and liability cover through 46 independent agents. Our head office is in Corlett, and our 140 staff work there and in claims offices in Ashby and Pelton. In 2025 we began offering cyber cover for small agricultural businesses. In good years we return part of our surplus to members as a policyholder dividend; the most recent was paid in 2024."},
            {"id": "c29-s2", "kind": "web_page", "text": "https://www.pellarden.example/news/2026-claims-system\nSeptember 2026: Pellarden Mutual has selected Tessaline as its new claims platform, replacing a system in use since 2004. CEO Annette Brody said the move would 'cut the time our members wait for a claims decision'. Tessaline will replace three separate tools, for first notice of loss, adjuster assignment and payments. The rollout will be phased, starting with property claims, and go-live is planned for mid-2027. Pellarden chose Tessaline after a six-month review of four platforms. Members will be told about changes in advance."},
