            {"id": "c31-s1", "kind": "web_page", "text": "https://www.ellwoodlibraries.example/about/budget-2027\nEllwood County Library District, proposed 2027 budget. Total operating budget $6.3 million, up 2.1% from 2026. Personnel 68% of spending; 94 FTE staff. Eleven branches, open a combined 512 hours a week. The Oakridge branch will close for renovation from March to September 2027, funded from $1.4 million in reserves. A levy renewal goes to voters in November 2027. Digital lending grew 18% in 2026 while physical circulation fell 4%. Active cardholders: 61,000. The board will adopt the final budget on 9 December."},
