            {"id": "c33-s1", "kind": "web_page", "text": "https://www.sorrelpeds.example/locations\nSorrel Pediatrics: five offices, at Linden, Westbrook, Garnet Hill, Tolland and Marsh End. Same-day sick visits at every office. Evening hours until 8pm at Linden and Westbrook, and a Saturday sick clinic at Westbrook from 9am to 1pm. Our 22 pediatricians and 9 nurse practitioners care for more than 30,000 children. Use our patient portal to see test results and send messages, and check in online before you arrive. Phone lines are open 7:30am to 6pm. New patients are welcome at all offices."},
