            {"id": "c37-s1", "kind": "web_page", "text": "https://www.mariscofoundation.example/annual-report-2025 (excerpt)\nIn 2025 the Marisco Community Foundation granted $4.2 million to 186 local organisations, up from $3.7 million in 2024. Our endowment stood at $61 million at year end, and we now hold 240 donor-advised funds. Our grantmaking priorities are housing stability, early learning and youth employment. We launched the Neighbourhood Fund, which makes small grants of up to $5,000 decided by resident panels. Staff: 12. President: Lorna Achterberg. We thank our 1,400 donors and the 31 residents who served on grant panels."},
