            {"id": "c38-s1", "kind": "web_page", "text": "https://www.kittredgehd.example/about\nKittredge Hardware Distributors supplies 900 independent hardware stores from distribution centres in Alder Falls and Dunmore. Family-owned since 1956, now led by third-generation CEO Rita Kittredge. We stock 48,000 items and deliver weekly to every store on our own trucks: 70 trucks and 120 drivers covering five states. Stores order through our KittNet portal by 2pm Friday for delivery the following week. In 2024 we opened a returns and repair centre at Alder Falls. Our buying team works with more than 200 suppliers."},
